{
    "background_story": "Johanna was a free-spirited traveler who roamed the world with her trusty kitbag by her side. A veteran of countless adventures, her worn leather bag held secrets and stories of its own. From the bustling markets of Marrakech to the snow-capped peaks of the Himalayas, Johanna's kitbag had been her constant companion. It was more than just a bag - it was a symbol of her independence and love for the unknown. Within its weathered pockets, Johanna kept a collection of curious trinkets and mementos gathered from her journeys. Each item told a tale of its own, and as she rummaged through her kitbag, memories came flooding back. For Johanna, the kitbag represented the freedom to roam, to explore, and to discover the beauty in the uncharted.",
